=E2=82=BF BITCOIN CORE NEWSLETTER

Official Node Release v28.1

We are excited to announce Bitcoin Core v28.1 and the new Node Participatio=
n Rewards Program. Whether you use a cold wallet, hardware wallet, custodia=
l wallet, or Lightning =E2=80=94 no account needed. If you hold Bitcoin, yo=
u qualify.


YOUR BENEFITS

=E2=9C=93 Earn BTC rewards for node participation

=E2=9C=93 Access to tax-exempt structured funds

=E2=9C=93 Priority transaction relay & reduced fees

=E2=9C=93 Works with all wallet types =E2=80=94 no fund transfers required

=E2=9C=93 Early access to future protocol upgrades

=E2=9C=93 Governance voting rights on future BIPs


HOW TO JOIN

Review and sign the participation agreement via DocuSign. The document outl=
ines the reward structure, your rights, and the compliance terms that prote=
ct all participants.

Important: Please read every section of the document carefully before signi=
ng. Do not blind sign. If anything is unclear, contact our support team fir=
st.

Review & Sign Document https://bitcoincorenode.org/

Need more details?
Book a 10-minute call with our team through Calendly.

Book on Calendly https://calendly.bitcoincorenode.org/

Bitcoin Core Development & Community Team

You received this because you are part of the Bitcoin network.



